From 0a00388d311c80f8e40942fe911053be11e6d8f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:44:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate all 53 tenant pages to fetchWithAuth for
 automatic session renewal

Every client-side fetch('/api/tenant/...) call is now routed through
fetchWithAuth, which silently refreshes the JWT on 401 and retries before
redirecting to login. Eliminates silent data-disappearing when sessions expire.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GuG33ES5Dv1To9X1kqPze4
